  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(A)</td>\t\t\t<td>Antipyretic</td>\t\t\t<td>(I)</td>\t\t\t<td>Reduces pain</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(B)</td>\t\t\t<td>Analgesic</td>\t\t\t<td>(II)</td>\t\t\t<td>Reduces stress</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(C)</td>\t\t\t<td>Tranquilizer</td>\t\t\t<td>(III)</td>\t\t\t<td>Reduces fever</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(D)</td>\t\t\t<td>Antacid</td>\t\t\t<td>(IV)</td>\t\t\t<td>Reduces acidity(stomach)</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>"
